<title>USA: T-NETIX says gets 3-year BellSouth contract.</title>
<headline>T-NETIX says gets 3-year BellSouth contract.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>T-NETIX Inc said Monday it was given a three-year contract with BellSouth Corp for installation of its inmate call processing system in the correctional facilities of Duval County, Florida.</p>
<p>The company said the revenue from the contract is expected to be about $850,000 during the next three years from BellSouth and the interexchange carrier. The company said this will be its first installation with BellSouth.</p>
</text>
